  "rationale": "Plant G1 models the robot's motion and perception interface, capturing all controllable actions and uncontrollable obstacle/path events. The specification E1 encodes the safe, coverage-biased exploration policy: move forward or random_walk in clear, use short turns for side obstacles, use move_backward for front obstacles, and only use full_rotate as a last-resort. Each recovery state enables only one recovery action, and transitions return to exploration as soon as path_clear is observed.",
